@name     scene_copy
@alias    scene_copy
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_scene_copy
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  copy scene definition and chain to another scene slot
@doc
Copies all 8 lane pattern assignments, loop count, and next-scene chain from source to destination.
Usage: src dst scene_copy
@code
    (void)ctx; (void)s; (void)argc;
    seq_scene_copy((int)args[0], (int)args[1]);
    return 0;
@end
